{"url": "https://x.com/zodchiii/status/2090778823050592662", "id": "2090778823050592662", "text": "how to build an entire team in under 10 minutes with grok bot?\n\ngrok bot is the closest thing to running a company with no employees\n\nguide:\n\n1. create a bot called Chief of Staff, it's your only entry point\n\n2. paste the description field, that's the whole config, there is no file\n\n3. connect 4 things only: inbox, calendar, news, one publishing channel\n\n4. add the other nine over the next two weeks, three at a time\n\none bot on top, nine underneath, and you only ever talk to one of them\n\nthen paste any article into your Chief of Staff and it distributes the work \n\nfull guide\ud83d\udc47", "raw_text": {"text": "how to build an entire team in under 10 minutes with grok bot?\n\ngrok bot is the closest thing to running a company with no employees\n\nguide:\n\n1. create a bot called Chief of Staff, it's your only entry point\n\n2. paste the description field, that's the whole config, there is no file\n\n3. connect 4 things only: inbox, calendar, news, one publishing channel\n\n4. add the other nine over the next two weeks, three at a time\n\none bot on top, nine underneath, and you only ever talk to one of them\n\nthen paste any article into your Chief of Staff and it distributes the work \n\nfull guide\ud83d\udc47", "display_text_range": [0, 583], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [278, 301], "id": "2090778364600623106", "display": "pic.x.com/bzWAknSa4G", "original": "https://t.co/bzWAknSa4G", "replacement": "https://x.com/zodchiii/status/2090778823050592662/video/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "zodchiii", "url": "https://x.com/zodchiii", "id": "1226636978256564226", "followers": 25722, "following": 364, "likes": 9847, "media_count": 736, "name": "darkzodchi", "description": "ai & finance entrepreneur \u2022 @zscdao member \u2022 sharing what I learn", "raw_description": {"text": "ai & finance entrepreneur \u2022 @zscdao member \u2022 sharing what I learn", "facets": []}, "location": "", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1226636978256564226/1767877872", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1999509933302124544/ABxY9N7S_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Sun Feb 09 22:40:28 +0000 2020", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "https://t.me/zodchixquant", "display_url": "t.me/zodchixquant"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "avatar_color": null}, "replies": 9, "retweets": 12, "likes": 132, "bookmarks": 199, "quotes": 0, "created_at": "Fri Aug 21 12:31:30 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787315490, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 16446, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "media": {"all": [{"id": "2090778364600623106", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/vid/avc1/1120x720/sa76nfeKhTPHb9EG.mp4?tag=29", "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2090778364600623106/img/hEQZYUw3r_MBSyoD.jpg", "duration": 31.55, "width": 1120, "height": 720, "format": "video/mp4", "type": "video", "formats": [{"url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/pl/cU2Q3cPr1ZDoMK3S.m3u8?tag=29", "container": "m3u8"}, {"url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/vid/avc1/420x270/jU2SaLmy1bOSDKMT.mp4?tag=29", "bitrate": 256000, "container": "mp4", "codec": "h264"}, {"url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/vid/avc1/560x360/Sj6_-u0Za0xdindk.mp4?tag=29", "bitrate": 832000, "container": "mp4", "codec": "h264"}, {"url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/vid/avc1/1120x720/sa76nfeKhTPHb9EG.mp4?tag=29", "bitrate": 2176000, "container": "mp4", "codec": "h264"}], "publisher": null, "variants": [{"url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2090778364600623106/pl/cU2Q3cPr1ZDoMK3S.m3u8?tag=29", "bitrate": 0, "content_type": "application/x-mpegURL"}, {"url": "https://